#
# The 97 rules of the 1986 Expert, one to one with the KEE.DEFRULEs in medley/EXPERT, as they run there.  Reasons are
# verbatim, and tests/test_expert.py checks every class, name, weight, reason and certainty against the listing.
# Rules are tried by descending weight, and a rule whose conclusion comes to no card hasn't fired.
#
# The rules keep the listing's oddities and the revival's fixes (HEARTS-BUGS.md section K), so that they behave as in
# Medley, and the oddities are noted where they occur.  Change them in a variant, in variants/.

class trick.evaluation: the strategy for the next trick
class passin.evaluation: the strategy after the pass
class initial.evaluation: the strategy before the pass
class opponent.trick.evaluation: how sure am I that this opponent is shooting, after this trick?
class opponent.passin.evaluation: what does this pass say about the passer?
class lead.play: minimizing, on the lead
class follow.play: minimizing, following suit
class dump.play: minimizing, unable to follow
class eclipse.lead: stopping a shooter, on the lead
class eclipse.follow: stopping a shooter, following suit
class eclipse.dump: stopping a shooter, unable to follow
class shoot.lead: shooting, on the lead
class shoot.follow: shooting, following suit
class shoot.dump: shooting, unable to follow
class minimizing.passout: each rule picks cards, and passing more than three makes it fail
class shooting.passout: each rule picks cards, and passing more than three makes it fail

# The thresholds the rules consult, as in medley/expert-kb.lisp.  The 1986 values are lost.  That file says where each of
# these came from: four from the overview's example, TriggerHappiness inferred from another, the rest judgement calls.
parameter TriggerHappiness: the trigger happiness = 0.5
parameter POMaxLowSpades: the most low spades to shoot before the pass = 2
parameter POMaxLoserHearts: the most loser hearts to shoot before the pass = 3
parameter POMinShootPoints: the fewest points to shoot before the pass = 15
parameter PIMaxLowSpades: the most low spades to shoot after the pass = 2
parameter PIMaxLoserHearts: the most loser hearts to shoot after the pass = 2
parameter PILowestHeart: the lowest heart rank to shoot after the pass = 10
parameter PIMinShootPoints: the fewest points to shoot after the pass = 15
parameter LowPassPoints: the low pass points = 0
parameter HiPassPoints: the high pass points = 6
parameter SpadeProtLen: the spade protection length = 4
parameter LastSingletonTrick: the last singleton trick = 6


# ---- trick.evaluation

rule trick.eval.cant.shoot in trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    my strategy is shooting
    the trick's points are above 0
    I did not win the trick
  then adopt minimizing

rule te.right.shooting in trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    my strategy is minimizing
    the right opponent is suspected of shooting
  then
    the shooter is the right opponent
    adopt eclipsing

rule te.left.shooting in trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    my strategy is minimizing
    the left opponent is suspected of shooting
  then
    the shooter is the left opponent
    adopt eclipsing

# It counts the suits I am void in as winner suits, but compares the count with the suits I hold.
rule te.go.for.it in trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    my strategy is eclipsing or my strategy is minimizing
    (the number of players with points is 1 and the points I have taken are above 0)
      or the number of players with points is 0
    the number of the suits I hold is the number of my winner suits
  then adopt shooting

rule te.across.shooting in trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    my strategy is minimizing
    the opponent across is suspected of shooting
  then
    the shooter is the opponent across
    adopt eclipsing

rule eclipse.success in trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    my strategy is eclipsing
    the number of players with points is above 1
  then adopt minimizing

rule trickeval.keep.strategy in trick.evaluation weight 0
  then adopt my strategy


# ---- passin.evaluation

rule pi.shoot.test in passin.evaluation weight 100
  when
    the high spade of my spades exists
      or the number of my spades is at most the most low spades to shoot after the pass
    let the loose hearts be my non-winners in hearts
    the loose hearts are empty
      or (the number of the loose hearts is at most the most loser hearts to shoot after the pass
          and the lowest of the loose hearts is higher than the lowest heart rank to shoot after the pass of hearts)
    the bridge points of my face cards are at least the fewest points to shoot after the pass
  then adopt shooting

rule pi.default.strategy in passin.evaluation weight 0
  then adopt minimizing


# ---- opponent.trick.evaluation

rule ote.only.point.taker in opponent.trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    the opponent won the trick
    the trick's points are at least 1
    the number of players with points is 1
  then the opponent is shooting with certainty 0.2

rule ote.no.shooting in opponent.trick.evaluation weight 100
  when the number of players with points is above 1
  then the opponent is shooting with certainty -0.99

rule ote.low.on.trick.1 in opponent.trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    the trick number is 1
    let the last play be the last card played by the opponent
    the last play is not the 2 of clubs
    the last play is lower than the 10 of the suit of the last play
  then the opponent is shooting with certainty 0.12

# It looks for the opponent's card among the cards left, which it has just left, so it never fires.
rule ote.dump.non.point in opponent.trick.evaluation weight 100
  when
    let the last play be the last card played by the opponent
    let its suit be the suit of the last play
    the lead suit is not its suit
    its suit is not hearts
    the last play is not the queen
    the last play is in the non-winners in its suit among the cards left
  then the opponent is shooting with certainty 0.11


# ---- opponent.passin.evaluation

rule ope.two.h.pass in opponent.passin.evaluation weight 100
  when
    let the hearts passed be the cards I was passed in hearts
    the number of the hearts passed is 2
    the bridge points of the hearts passed are below 4
  then the opponent is shooting with certainty 0.2

rule ope.min.is.normal in opponent.passin.evaluation weight 100
  then the opponent is minimizing with certainty 0.3

rule ope.low.pass in opponent.passin.evaluation weight 100
  when the bridge points of the cards I was passed are at most the low pass points
  then the opponent is shooting with certainty 0.3

rule ope.high.pass in opponent.passin.evaluation weight 100
  when the bridge points of the cards I was passed are at least the high pass points
  then the opponent is minimizing with certainty 0.5

rule ope.all.h.pass in opponent.passin.evaluation weight 100
  when
    let the hearts passed be the cards I was passed in hearts
    the number of the hearts passed is 3
    the bridge points of the hearts passed are below 4
  then the opponent is shooting with certainty 0.4


# ---- initial.evaluation

rule default.strategy in initial.evaluation weight 0
  then adopt minimizing

rule shoot.test in initial.evaluation weight 100
  when
    the high spade of my spades exists
      or the number of my spades is at most the most low spades to shoot before the pass
    the number of my non-winners in hearts is at most the most loser hearts to shoot before the pass
    the bridge points of my face cards are at least the fewest points to shoot before the pass
  then adopt shooting


# ---- every play class: nothing to decide

rule one.choice in lead.play, follow.play, dump.play, eclipse.lead, eclipse.follow, eclipse.dump, shoot.lead, shoot.follow, shoot.dump weight 1000
  reason "One choice."
  when the number of my legal cards is 1
  then play the first of my legal cards


# ---- lead.play

rule lead.lowest.non.winner in lead.play weight 50
  reason "Leading lowest non-winner."
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of the non-winners among my legal cards

rule lead.lowest.non.s in lead.play weight 70
  reason "Leading lowest non-spade."
  when
    I hold the queen
    let the candidates be my legal cards except spades that are also in the non-winners among my legal cards
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of the candidates

rule lead.lowest in lead.play, shoot.lead weight 0
  reason "Leading lowest card."
  then play the lowest of my legal cards

rule lead.heart in lead.play weight 60
  reason "Leading a heart. What the hey."
  when my legal cards in hearts are not empty
  then play the highest of my losers in hearts

# It tests the trick number against 6, where lead.single.club consults the personality.
rule lead.single.diamond in lead.play weight 100
  reason "Leading my singleton diamond."
  when
    the trick number is below 6
    let the diamonds be my legal cards in diamonds
    the number of the diamonds is 1
    the first of the diamonds is not equivalent to the winner of diamonds
  then play the first of the diamonds

rule lead.single.club in lead.play weight 90
  reason "Leading my singleton club."
  when
    the trick number is below the last singleton trick
    let the clubs be my legal cards in clubs
    the number of the clubs is 1
    the first of the clubs is not equivalent to the winner of clubs
  then play the first of the clubs

rule lead.queen.hunt in lead.play weight 80
  reason "Looking for the maggie."
  when
    the queen has not been played
    let the spades be my legal cards in spades
    the spades are not empty
    the highest of the spades is lower than the queen
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of the spades


# ---- follow.play

rule safe.play.QS in follow.play weight 110
  reason "Min - looks like someone's munching the maggie."
  when the queen is in my legal cards in the lead suit lower than the trick's highest card
  then play the queen

rule follow.not.QS in follow.play weight 80
  reason "Playing something other than the QS."
  when the lowest of my legal cards is the queen
  then play the lowest card equivalent to the highest of my legal cards among my legal cards except the queen

rule follow.lowest.non.s in follow.play weight 60
  reason "Playing lowest non spade. A silly rule."
  when
    I hold the queen
    let the candidates be my legal cards except spades that are also in the non-winners among my legal cards
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of the candidates among the candidates

rule follow.lowest in follow.play, shoot.follow weight 0
  reason "Following with lowest card."
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of my legal cards among my legal cards

rule follow.last.must.win in follow.play weight 110
  reason "Playing last; must win trick; will play high."
  when
    the trick has 3 cards
    my legal cards in the lead suit lower than the trick's highest card are empty
    let the nice cards be my legal cards except the queen
  then play the lowest card equivalent to the highest of the nice cards among the nice cards

rule follow.last.high.safe in follow.play weight 80
  reason "Playing last; trick is safe; going high."
  when
    the trick has 3 cards
    the trick's points are 0
    let the nice cards be my legal cards except the queen
  then play the lowest card equivalent to the highest of the nice cards among the nice cards

rule follow.last.above.QS in follow.play weight 90
  reason "Playing last; avoiding QS."
  when
    the queen is in my legal cards
    the trick has 3 cards
    the highest of my legal cards is higher than the queen
  then play the highest of my legal cards

rule follow.highest.below.QS in follow.play weight 70
  reason "Playing below QS on a safe trick."
  when
    the queen has not been played
    the trick's points are 0
  then play the highest of my legal cards in spades lower than the queen

rule third.plays.hi.c.or.d in follow.play weight 65
  reason "No harm to play high in third position."
  when
    the trick has 2 cards
    the trick's points are 0
    the lead suit is clubs or the lead suit is diamonds
      or (the lead suit is spades
          and (the queen has been played
               or (the queen has not been played and the highest of my legal cards is lower than the queen)))
  then play the lowest card equivalent to the highest of my legal cards among my legal cards

rule safe.play in follow.play weight 70
  reason "Normal play - highest under highest played."
  when
    let the safe cards be my legal cards in the lead suit lower than the trick's highest card
  then play the lowest card equivalent to the highest of the safe cards among the safe cards

rule follow.t1.hi.c in follow.play weight 90
  reason "Min - playing high on first trick."
  when the trick number is 1
  then play the lowest card equivalent to the highest of my legal cards among my legal cards


# ---- dump.play

rule dump.hi.s in dump.play weight 90
  reason "Dumping my highest spade."
  when the queen has not been played
  then play the high spade of my legal cards

rule dump.hi.non.s in dump.play weight 75
  reason "Min - dumping my highest non-spade."
  when I hold the queen
  then play the highest of my legal cards except spades

rule dump.hi.card in dump.play weight 70
  reason "Min - dumping my highest card."
  then play the highest of my legal cards

rule dump.h in dump.play weight 80
  reason "Min - dumping a heart. Sorry."
  then play the highest of my legal cards in hearts

rule dump.queen in dump.play weight 100
  reason "Min - dumping the maggie. Heh, heh."
  when the queen is in my legal cards
  then play the queen


# ---- eclipse.lead

rule elead.shooter.void in eclipse.lead weight 80
  reason "Eclipsing - leading a card in the shooter's void suit."
  then play the lowest of my legal cards in the void suits of the shooter

rule elead.non.shooter.void in eclipse.lead weight 90
  reason "Eclipsing - leading a card in a non-shooter's void suit."
  then play the highest of my legal cards in the void suits of hearty non-shooters

rule elead.lowest.shortest.suit in eclipse.lead weight 0
  reason "Eclipsing - leading a card in my shortest suit."
  then play the lowest of my legal cards in the shortest suit of my legal cards

rule elead.lead.h in eclipse.lead weight 100
  reason "Eclipsing - leading a low heart; the shooter is void in them."
  when hearts is in the void suits of the shooter
  then play the lowest of my legal cards in hearts


# ---- eclipse.follow

rule efol.womp.3 in eclipse.follow weight 50
  reason "Eclipsing - hoping to take this trick with points."
  when
    the trick's points are above 0
    the trick's card from the shooter does not exist
    let the top be the highest of my legal cards in the lead suit
    the top is higher than the trick's highest card
    the top is not equivalent to the trick's highest card
  then play the top

rule efol.womp.2 in eclipse.follow weight 60
  reason "Eclipsing - going to take this trick with points."
  when
    the trick's points are above 0
    the trick's card from the shooter does not exist
    the trick's highest card is in the non-winners in the lead suit among the cards left
    let the top be the highest of my legal cards in the lead suit
    the winner of the lead suit is equivalent to the top
  then play the top

# Trick.WinnerSoFar usually names the wrong seat, here and in edump.screw.shooter and edump.no.points.
rule efol.womp.1 in eclipse.follow weight 70
  reason "Eclipsing - going to go over the shooter on this trick with points."
  when
    the trick's points are above 0
    let the shooter's card be the trick's card from the shooter
    the shooter's card exists
    the shooter is winning so far
  then play the lowest of my legal cards in the lead suit higher than the shooter's card

rule efol.low.play in eclipse.follow weight 0
  reason "Eclipsing - playing my lowest card."
  then play the lowest of my legal cards

rule efol.dump.queen in eclipse.follow weight 70
  reason "Eclipsing - sacrificing the queen for the glory of mankind."
  when
    the trick's card from the shooter exists
    the lead suit is spades
    the queen is in my legal cards
    the queen is higher than the trick's highest card
  then play the queen


# ---- eclipse.dump

rule edump.shooter.void in eclipse.dump weight 93
  reason "Eclipsing - dumping a shooter void card."
  then play the highest of my legal cards in the void suits of the shooter

rule edump.hope.to.screw.shooter in eclipse.dump weight 95
  reason "Eclipsing - hoping a non-shooter wins this one; dumping low point card."
  when
    the point cards in my legal cards are not empty
    let the shooter's card be the trick's card from the shooter
    the shooter's card exists
    the shooter's card is not equivalent to the winner of the lead suit
  then play the queen if I can otherwise the lowest of my legal cards

rule edump.useless in eclipse.dump weight 80
  reason "Eclipsing - dumping a useless suit."
  then play the highest of my legal cards in the suits where every card left is mine

rule edump.short.suit.nonwinners in eclipse.dump weight 70
  reason "Eclipsing - dumping a short suit non-winner."
  when
    let the non-winners be the non-winners among my legal cards
  then play the lowest of the non-winners in the shortest suit of the non-winners

rule edump.screw.shooter in eclipse.dump weight 100
  reason "Eclipsing - dumping a point card on a non-shooter!"
  when
    the point cards in my legal cards are not empty
    the trick's card from the shooter exists
    the shooter is not winning so far
  then play the queen if I can otherwise the highest of my legal cards

rule edump.no.points in eclipse.dump weight 90
  reason "Eclipsing - dumping a non-winner on the shooter."
  when the shooter is winning so far
  then play the lowest of (the non-winners among my legal cards) except the point cards in my legal cards

rule edump.lowest in eclipse.dump weight 0
  reason "Eclipsing - dumping my lowest card."
  then play the lowest of my legal cards


# ---- shoot.lead (and lead.lowest, above)

rule lead.lowest.except.QS in shoot.lead weight 10
  reason "Leading lowest non-QS card."
  then play the lowest of my legal cards except the queen

rule slead.non.op.void.loser in shoot.lead weight 125
  reason "Shooting - leading non-QS non-winner non-opponent void card."
  then play the highest of (the non-winners among my legal cards) except my winner suits except the queen
         except the void suits of hearty opponents

rule slead.lowest.winner.except.QS in shoot.lead weight 120
  reason "Shooting - leading a non-QS winner."
  when
    let the winner suit cards be my legal cards in my winner suits
    the winner suit cards are not empty
  then play the lowest of (the winners among the winner suit cards) except the queen

rule slead.loser.except.QS in shoot.lead weight 110
  reason "Shooting - leading a non-QS non-winner."
  then play the highest of (the non-winners among my legal cards) except my winner suits except the queen

rule slead.hearts in shoot.lead weight 130
  reason "Shooting - leading hearts to clean up this game."
  when
    hearts is a winner suit
    the queen has been played
    my legal cards in hearts are not empty
  then play the lowest card equivalent to the winner of hearts among my legal cards


# ---- shoot.follow (and follow.lowest, above)

rule sfol.trick.1.low in shoot.follow weight 100
  reason "Shooting - playing low on first trick."
  when the trick number is 1
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of my legal cards among my legal cards

# It compares its card with the highest of the trick whatever the suits.
rule sfol.must.take in shoot.follow weight 90
  reason "Shooting - must take this one."
  when
    the trick's points are above 0
    let the card be the lowest card equivalent to the highest of my legal cards among my legal cards
    the card is higher than the highest of the trick's cards
  then play the card

rule sfol.little.over in shoot.follow weight 70
  reason "Shooting - going a little bit over."
  when
    let the cards above be my legal cards in the lead suit higher than the trick's highest card
    the cards above are not empty
    the number of the cards between the lowest of the cards above and the trick's highest card is at most 4
  then play the lowest of the cards above

rule sfol.last.dump.loser in shoot.follow weight 80
  reason "Shooting - following with loser on last play."
  when
    the trick has 3 cards
    the trick's points are 0
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of my legal cards among my legal cards


# ---- shoot.dump

rule sdump.lowest in shoot.dump weight 0
  reason "Shooting - dumping lowest card."
  then play the lowest of my legal cards

# compute.weak.suit often finds a suit I am void in, and then this fails.
rule dump.weak.suit.loser in shoot.dump weight 100
  reason "Shooting - dumping a weak suit non-winner."
  when
    the weakest suit exists
    let the weak cards be the non-winners in the weakest suit among my legal cards
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of the weak cards among the weak cards

rule dump.non.winner in shoot.dump weight 80
  reason "Shooting - dumping a non-winner."
  when
    let the candidates be (the non-winners among my legal cards) except hearts except the queen
  then play the highest card equivalent to the lowest of the candidates among the candidates

rule dump.loser in shoot.dump weight 90
  reason "Shoot - dumping a loser."
  then play the highest of (the losers among my legal cards) except hearts except the queen

rule compute.weak.suit in shoot.dump weight 100
  then the weakest suit is the suit with the fewest winners other than hearts


# ---- minimizing.passout

rule highest.pick in minimizing.passout weight 5
  then pass the highest of my hand

rule highest.non.s.pick in minimizing.passout weight 50
  when
    let the pick be the highest of my hand except spades
    the pick exists
  then pass the pick

rule two.d in minimizing.passout weight 70
  when the number of my diamonds is 2
  then pass the highest of my diamonds

rule short.c in minimizing.passout weight 60
  when
    my clubs are not empty
    the number of my clubs is below 3
  then pass my clubs

rule s.prot?.1 in minimizing.passout weight 10
  when the number of my spades is below the spade protection length
  then conclude my spade protection is poor

rule pass.hi.s in minimizing.passout weight 100
  when
    the highest of my spades is higher than the jack of spades
    my spade protection is poor
  then pass the highest of my spades

rule pass.hi.h in minimizing.passout weight 90
  when the highest of my hearts is higher than the jack of hearts
  then pass the highest of my hearts

rule one.d in minimizing.passout weight 70
  when the number of my diamonds is 1
  then pass the first of my diamonds


# ---- shooting.passout

# pass.lowest and pass.any.non.winner can never fire: pass.lowest.non.s comes first, and it only fails to pass a card when
# I have nothing but spades, by passing no card, which is SHOULDNT (a break in Medley, checked there).
rule pass.lowest.non.s in shooting.passout weight 20
  then pass the lowest of my hand except spades

rule pass.lowest in shooting.passout weight 0
  then pass the lowest of my hand

rule pass.loser.h in shooting.passout weight 90
  when the lowest of my hearts is in my non-winners in hearts
  then pass the lowest of my hearts

rule pass.any.non.winner in shooting.passout weight 10
  when
    let the candidates be my non-winners in diamonds plus my non-winners in clubs
    the candidates are not empty
  then pass the lowest of the candidates

rule pass.all.loser.h in shooting.passout weight 100
  then pass my non-winners in hearts
